        TSGen["<b>TSGen</b> (Zhang et al. 2024)<br/>Term Set Generation<br/>for Generative Retrieval<br/><br/>• Permutation-invariant<br/>• Learned term weights<br/>• Error-resilient decoding<br/>• Inverted-index efficient"]
